  "observations": [
    "Two small round inlet flap assemblies are mounted on the enlarged inner cup, behind the visor. The upper exterior valve pair has been removed.",
    "Cup Off removes the enlarged cup and both inlet assemblies while the optional filters remain; Filters Off leaves the cup and inlets visible.",
    "The original narrow Scuba cup is preserved as a separate named variant. Hardware, tint and opacity choices remain when switching variants.",
    "Valve Off removes the raised external chin assembly; the existing visor valve port remains.",
    "Hair and hairpin were temporarily hidden through CNS for hood inspection. The mod contains no hair assets or automatic hair-hiding behavior.",
